WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:07.480
A request for three practical first steps
for a Saturday bookshop pop-up.

00:07.480 --> 00:16.300
Kyoto responds through a connected provider.

00:16.300 --> 00:21.844
Confirm a place and time. Choose books and prices.
Arrange a table, payment method, and a simple sign.
